# Arquivos que o Cursor nao deve ler nem indexar.
# Binarios compilados, saidas de teste e dados de mercado nao acrescentam
# contexto e so consomem a janela do modelo.

# --- compilados do MetaEditor ---
*.ex5
*.ex4

# --- saidas do EA ---
*.csv
*.log
*.htm
*.html
Files/
Logs/
Tester/
Reports/

# --- dados de mercado ---
*.hst
*.hcc
*.fxt
*.tkc
*.dat

# --- configuracoes locais e presets ---
*.set
*.ini
*.chr
*.tpl

# --- sistema operacional ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- backups ---
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
_old/
